flowchart LR
    SRC[AgentSpeak / JaCaMo source span] --> ELEM[Normalized BDI / MAS element]
    ELEM --> MAP{Confirmed correspondence?}
    MAP -->|yes| UML[Qualified UML / OCL target]
    MAP -->|no| GAP[Explicit missing / stale mapping gap]
    UML --> RULE[Applicable bounded rule]
    GAP --> RULE
    RULE --> ISSUE[Issue status / severity / certainty]
    ISSUE --> EVID[Evidence tokens and suggested fix]
    EVID --> REPORT[Deterministic JSON / HTML]
    EVID --> VIEW[Read-only diagram highlight]

    PROFILE[Analysis-profile descriptor] -. provenance .-> REPORT
    PROFILE -. vocabulary .-> VIEW

    AUTH[Jason and USE remain syntax / UML-OCL authorities] -. boundary .-> SRC
    RUNTIME[No JaCaMo runtime, live CArtAgO state, or Moise enactment] -. limitation .-> VIEW
